macOS 27 Golden Gate is in beta ahead of a fall release, and we thought we'd go over what's new for those who don't want to risk beta software on their Mac. <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/macos-27/">macOS Golden Gate</a> adds <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> AI, Liquid Glass updates, and multiple new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-intelligence/">Apple Intelligence</a> features.<br/>
<br/>
